        skos:definition     "An alternative lexical label for a resource."@en ;
        skos:example        "Acronyms, abbreviations, spelling variants, and irregular plural/singular\n      forms may be included among the alternative labels for a concept. Mis-spelled terms\n      are normally included as hidden labels (see skos:hiddenLabel)."@en .

